        "collapsible_tab-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "heading": "Benefits",
            "content": "<p>We've carefully selected premium ingredients that work in harmony, offering a complete and holistic solution to enhance women's health while addressing every facet of menstrual well-being.</p><p>Based on your hormone needs and your cycle health goals we will create your personal formula.</p><p><strong>Relief of Cramps:</strong><br/>Magnesium helps relax uterine muscles, providing relief from cramps.</p><p><strong>Reduce Bloating:</strong><br/>Choline supports metabolism, which helps reduce bloating. At the same time, broccoli extract, containing sulforaphane, boosts gut function and reduces inflammation. Additionally, vitamin B6 can aid in fluid balance, reducing the sensation of bloating.</p><p><strong>Prevent PMS:</strong><br/>Vitamin B6 is known to alleviate PMS symptoms like mood swings and irritability. Calcium citrate also reduces the severity of PMS symptoms such as cramps, bloating, and headaches.</p><p><strong>Regulate Mood:</strong><br/>L-glycine supports mood regulation, and vitamin B6 is essential for neurotransmitter synthesis, which affects mood.</p><p><strong>Balance Hormones:</strong> Linseed extract contains lignans and omega-3 fatty acids, which help regulate hormones. Choline supports hormone production and metabolism. Additionally, vitamin D plays a role in hormone regulation.</p><p><strong>Prevent Hormone Skin Issues:</strong> Vitamin E possesses antioxidant properties that promote healthy skin. Moreover, Zinc citrate is essential for skin health and may help prevent hormone-related skin issues</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "leaf",
            "heading": "INGREDIENTS",
            "content": "<p>Based on your hormone test we will select the right blend for you from the following ingredients:</p><p><strong>Dietary information:</strong></p><p>Vegetarian | GMO-Free | Lactose-Free | Soy-Free | Gluten-Free</p><p><strong>Minerals:</strong></p><ul><li>Calcium citrate</li><li>Magnesium (magnesium glycerophosphate)</li><li>Zinc citrate</li><li>Chromium picolinate</li><li>L-selenomethionine</li><li>Sodium molybdate</li><li>Potassium iodide</li></ul><p><strong>Plant Extracts:</strong></p><ul><li>Linseed extract</li><li>Turmeric extract (Curcuma longa L.)</li><li>Broccoli extract (Brassica oleracea L.)</li><li>Kudzu extract (Pueraria lobata)</li><li>Flaxseed</li><li>Licorice</li><li>Maca</li><li>Curcumin</li><li>Reishi mushroom</li></ul><p><strong>Vitamins:</strong></p><ul><li>Ascorbic acid</li><li>Vitamin E (D-alpha-tocopheryl acetate)</li><li>Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide)</li><li>Vitamin B6 (Pyridoxal-5-phosphate)</li><li>Vitamin B5 (Calcium pantothenate)</li><li>Vitamin A (Beta-carotene)</li><li>Vitamin B2 (Riboflavin)</li><li>Thiamin HCl</li><li>Vitamin A (Retinyl palmitate)</li><li>Vitamin B12 (Methylcobalamin)</li><li>Folate (Calcium-L-methylfolate)</li><li>Biotin</li><li>Vitamin K (Phytomenadione)</li><li>Vitamin D (Cholecalciferol)</li></ul><p><strong>Amino Acids and Related Compounds:</strong></p><ul><li>Choline (choline bitartrate)</li><li>L-glycine</li><li>N-acetyl-L-cysteine</li><li>L-threonine</li><li>L-lysine HCl</li><li>L-cysteine HCl</li></ul><p><strong>Other Ingredients:</strong></p><ul><li>Sweetener: Steviol glycosides</li><li>Anti-caking agent: Silicon dioxide</li><li>Reduced glutathione</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "24692597-3eda-44e6-a1a6-675dadcd9381": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "bottle",
            "heading": "HOW IT WORKS",
            "content": "<p><strong>STEP 1.</strong> Test your hormone balance with our at-home saliva hormone test<br/><br/><strong>STEP 2.</strong> Get your results and your personal powder. Optionally connect with an expert to discuss your cycle health goals<br/><br/><strong>STEP 3. </strong>Get your personalised formula</p><p><strong>STEP 4. </strong>Thrive on your formula with one scoop a day</p><ul><li><strong>Scoop: </strong>One convenient daily morning dose</li><li><strong>Mix:</strong> Stir with your preferred morning drink</li><li><strong>Enjoy:</strong> Drink our unique blend every day</li><li><strong>Thrive:</strong> Feel results month after month</li></ul>",
