            "image_position": "center center",
            "heading": "Comprehensive at-home saliva hormone test (1 test)",
            "description": "<p>Our at-home hormone saliva test provides you a convenient and in-depth analysis of your hormonal health and personalised recommendations to tackle any underlying issues.<br/><br/><strong>Measures 6 biomarkers:<br/></strong>Your steroid hormones tell us if your primary hormones are within normal ranges. Abnormal levels may be causing symptoms that affect your cycle and overall well-being.<br/></p><ul><li>DHEA</li><li>Estradiol</li><li>Estriol</li><li>Cortisol</li><li>Progesterone</li><li>Testosterone</li></ul><p><br/><strong>What's included:</strong></p><ul><li>Includes vessels (x3) </li><li>Straw (x3)</li><li>Labels (x3)</li><li>Saliva Extraction Instructions (x1)</li></ul><p>For secure and convenient sample collection.</p><ul><li>Accompanying Document (x1)</li><li>Guarantee Certificate (x1)</li><li>Shipping Container (x1)</li><li>Mailing Bag (x1)</li></ul>",
