            "image_position": "center center",
            "heading": "Personal hormone report (1 report in pdf.)",
            "description": "<p>Once we have analysed your hormonal levels, we provide a comprehensive report of your hormones in PDF and printed formats, along with a set of recommendations and guidance.<br/><br/><strong>A closer look at your hormones during each cycle phase: </strong></p><ul><li>Follicular phase</li><li>Ovulation phase</li><li>Luteal phase</li><li>Menstrual phase</li></ul>",
