            "image_position": "center center",
            "heading": "Optional 1:1 expert consultation (30 mins)",
            "description": "<p>We’re a team of women specialised in hormone balance, menstrual health, and natural solutions. <br/><br/>Enhance your Monthlies experience by connecting with us.<br/><br/><strong>When<br/></strong>You can schedule a free consultation with one of our experts to discuss your hormone test results and personalised formula after shipping your saliva test.<br/><br/><strong>What<br/></strong>We'll go over your hormone levels together, talk about your cycle health goals, and discuss your personalised formula.<br/><br/><strong>How<br/></strong>Your free consultation with one of our experts takes place online via video call or chat, at a date and time that suit you. We'll send you a mail with a link after the purchase.</p>",
