            "description": "<p>Learn how the choices you make every day affect your hormones with 8 expert-curated cards, and find easy tips to feel better and stay healthy. Included printed in your order.</p><p><strong><br/>Topics covered:</strong></p><ul><li>Nutrition</li><li>Therapies</li><li>Relaxation</li><li>Exercise</li><li>Sleep</li><li>Other</li></ul>",
