          "settings": {
            "title": "Our mission",
            "text": "<p>At Monthlies, we aim to help all women have a pain-free period, while providing the best possible care for their overall well-being. Above all, this means getting \"WOW\" results.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "template--19563952963931__95a6a521-bd8d-4e65-bbdc-7e38727166a9-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our expertise",
            "text": "<p>Our team of female experts and in-house naturopathic doctors, is dedicated to putting science first in everything we do. <br/><br/>We pride ourselves on offering a comprehensive cycle wellbeing service: from helping you to understand your cycle to product curation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "96d41e3c-7f6e-4db6-936a-3604d771c17e": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our delivery policy",
            "text": "<p>We currently offer shipping throughout Germany and UK. </p><p>We strive to ship and deliver your order as quickly and efficiently as possible.</p><p>Your order will be processed within 1-2 business days, at which time you will receive a confirmation email with a tracking number. From there, our standard shipping times range from 3-5 business days.</p>"
          }
        }
